<title>USA: Medical Graphics Corp Q3 profit vs loss.</title>
<headline>Medical Graphics Corp Q3 profit vs loss.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr profit		$ 0.03     loss	$ 0.09</p>
<p> Net profit		    73     loss	   215</p>
<p> Revs			 6,010		    5,611</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   2,556		    2,444</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>	  NINE MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr loss		 $  0.68     loss     $  0.64</p>
<p> Net loss		   1,721     loss	 1,567</p>
<p> Revs			16,413		   15,983</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   2,539		    2,441</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 Q3 profit and nine months loss include non-operating income of $1.3 million which is the payment received from SensorMedics Corp as a result of an acquisition of SensorMedics by ThermoElectron Corp.</p>
